<title>HONG KONG: RBI Holdings 1996 net rises 57.28 pct.</title>
<headline>RBI Holdings 1996 net rises 57.28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.8   vs  24.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    75.99  vs  48.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		     406.19 vs  362.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 RBI Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 26-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 18</p>
<p>NOTE - RBI Holdings is a toymaker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nine H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs two cents (cash distribution).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
